{"ids":{"anilist":21399,"mal":31757},"titles":{"romaji":"Kizumonogatari II: Nekketsu-hen","english":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Nekketsu","native":"傷物語〈Ⅱ熱血篇〉"},"format":"MOVIE","status":"FINISHED","season":"SUMMER","season_year":2016,"episodes":1,"duration":68,"description":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 3/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n<br><br>\nIn the spring of his second year of high school, Koyomi Araragi met the beautiful vampire Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade. Koyomi saved Kiss-shot, who was on the verge of death with all four of her limbs cut off, but only at the expense of becoming her minion and a vampire. “In order to go back to being a human again, you must take back all of Kiss-shot’s limbs.” After receiving advice from Meme Oshino, an expert in the supernatural, Koyomi prepares to go into battle.\n<br><br>\nAwaiting him are three powerful vampire hunters—Dramaturgy, a giant vampire hunter who is a vampire himself. Episode, a half-vampire who wields an enormous cross, and Guillotinecutter, a quiet man who specializes in killing vampires. Will Koyomi be able to take back Kiss-Shot’s limbs from the vampire hunters? Amidst the soft spring rain, the curtain rises on this fateful blood bath…\n<br><br>\n(Source: Aniplex)","genres":["Action","Drama","Ecchi","Mystery","Psychological","Supernatural"],"score_anilist":85,"popularity":143731,"images":{"poster":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21399-VTAdAqc8u5AE.png","poster_color":"#28aee4","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21399-vCKFTNkrYLIz.jpg"},"anilist":{"id":21399,"idMal":31757,"title":{"romaji":"Kizumonogatari II: Nekketsu-hen","english":"Kizumonogatari Part 2: Nekketsu","native":"傷物語〈Ⅱ熱血篇〉","userPreferred":"Kizumonogatari II: Nekketsu-hen"},"description":"First season of the Monogatari Series, part 3/6. Contains the arc Koyomi Vamp from the Kizumonogatari light novel.\n<br><br>\nIn th